flag-barack-attack/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.blessedquietness.com/journal/balaam.htm</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/3879925807944924247'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/3879925807944924247'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1337321445960#c3879925807944924247' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-478880690"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 18, 2012 at 12:10 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2412663563221232839</id><published>2012-05-16T22:35:19.624-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-16T22:35:19.624-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Every cop is a criminal; and before anyone should ...</title><content type='html'>Every cop is a criminal; and before anyone should jump to conclusions about me: I&amp;#39;ve never been arrested.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/2412663563221232839'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/2412663563221232839'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1337229319624#c2412663563221232839' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1082906600"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 16, 2012 at 10:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7786783069551260785</id><published>2012-05-10T09:52:58.219-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-10T09:52:58.219-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The key to understanding the rampant torture aroun...</title><content type='html'>The key to understanding the rampant torture around the world is to recognize that the &amp;quot;ritual&amp;quot; in Satanic Ritual Abuse is meant in the sense of being repetitive.  Its purpose is to align the perpetrators&amp;#39; will with that of certain subhuman Satanic beings of destruction known as Satanic demons (as opposed to Luciferic demons, for example, which stimulate creativity).  The perps, who typically don&amp;#39;t even know they&amp;#39;re Satanists, believe that SRA will confer some superhuman qualities upon them, per Nietzsche, Crowley, and others. Once this alignment occurs, these Satanic beings suddenly take possession, and the perpetrator becomes a freak of nature, a human controlled by a subhuman being of destruction, for the rest of his physical life.  This is symbolized by the movie The Fly, in which the teleportation chamber represents SRA. (It just so happens the demon Beelzebub/Mammon is the Lord of the Flies, i.e. their group soul.) This freak of nature is compelled to destroy mainly human beings, such as by contriving wars and creating an oppressive world order. Advocates of &amp;quot;enhanced interrogation&amp;quot; call this destruction of human souls &amp;quot;learned helplessness.&amp;quot;  Orwell called it &amp;quot;the obliteration of the self,&amp;quot; which is the actual subject of 1984, and which just so happens to be the top-level agenda of the forces of evil. (Note that the Nazis were the first to use &amp;quot;enhanced interrogation.&amp;quot;) Orwell predicted a future symbolized by a &amp;quot;boot stamping on a human face, forever.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7786783069551260785'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7786783069551260785'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336665178219#c7786783069551260785' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-769530359"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 10, 2012 at 9:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4070062593868404698</id><published>2012-05-09T01:47:35.033-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-09T01:47:35.033-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous wrote, &amp;quot;Useful idiots for their pol...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous wrote, &amp;quot;Useful idiots for their political masters&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m reminded of this bit:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Fuzzy Logic Of Useful Idiots&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;... We call these people “Useful Idiots”.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;How does one know when he has encountered such a person? How does he cope? Let’s examine some of the telltale signs of the useful idiot… &amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.alt-market.com/neithercorp/press/2010/11/the-fuzzy-logic-of-useful-idiots/</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/4070062593868404698'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/4070062593868404698'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336549655033#c4070062593868404698' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2015471208"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 9, 2012 at 1:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7482342211504144077</id><published>2012-05-05T11:47:39.696-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-05T11:47:39.696-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why does the DEA exist? They are no where authoriz...</title><content type='html'>Why does the DEA exist? They are no where authorized in the Constitution and seem to be the antithesis of legitimate government. i.e. They violate rights rather than protect them.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If this criminal, rogue, agency keeps it up the idea of shooting them in self defense will catch on and even sway juries.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7482342211504144077'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7482342211504144077'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336240059696#c7482342211504144077' title=''/><author><name>InalienableWrights</name><uri>http://jtittiger.blogspot.com/2012/03/are-you-victim-of-christian-persecution.html</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-351966981"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 5, 2012 at 11:47 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6993006353027446688</id><published>2012-05-05T10:26:45.953-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-05T10:26:45.