 ...</title><content type='html'>@ anonymous rick ;-)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well...the legal system may not be what I want it to be, but you will note that I did get a form of justice in that I was exonerated. It wasn&amp;#39;t quick, and what happened wasn&amp;#39;t fair - but it did work. Now we need to change things so prosecutors, cops, and judges are punished for bad behavior.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/8498584301086436638'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/8498584301086436638'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336184833322#c8498584301086436638' title=''/><author><name>PJL</name><uri>http://www.rush-to-judgement.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1736745393"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 8:27 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3428726211092456756</id><published>2012-05-04T19:37:01.768-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T19:37:01.768-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Stop The Adult Prison Transfer Of My minor Son. 4b...</title><content type='html'>Stop The Adult Prison Transfer Of My minor Son. 4brycesbattle. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exculpatory Evidence Withheld in States Murder Charge against my CHILD. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;https://therelentlessmom.wordpress.com/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;please read the Evidence List. &lt;br /&gt;A heartbroken mom.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/3428726211092456756'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/3428726211092456756'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336181821768#c3428726211092456756' title=''/><author><name>Bryces Battle</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11653619323222656569</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-9kYLLdgNKNY/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAB40/uT1_9pc6Qg8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-723462916"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 7:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7594795257596695044</id><published>2012-05-04T18:32:06.333-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T18:32:06.333-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What exactly is it that is being protected in this...</title><content type='html'>What exactly is it that is being protected in this country anymore, as the various layers of governments and so called patriots claim they are doing? Wave the flag and keep your head in the sand! It would be nice if the subjects in this country would crack a history book once in a while and read where this kind of crap leads to. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The police are the worst. Useful idiots for their political masters.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7594795257596695044'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/7594795257596695044'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336177926333#c7594795257596695044' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-940904423"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 6:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1001590870537158442</id><published>2012-05-04T18:18:32.717-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T18:18:32.717-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Wow! evil all around us. Great Blog and excellent ...</title><content type='html'>Wow! evil all around us. Great Blog and excellent subjects. By chance do you have blogs about my minor child&amp;#39;s tragic position...&lt;br /&gt;Wrongfully Convicted, Exculpatory Evidence Witheld, Scheduled to be transfered Into Adult Notorious Unit-Cell-Open bay. and where is a MoM to turn for help for her son? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kind Regards, 4brycesbattle.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/1001590870537158442'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/1001590870537158442'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336177112717#c1001590870537158442' title=''/><author><name>Bryces Battle</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11653619323222656569</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh4.googleusercontent.com/-9kYLLdgNKNY/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAB40/uT1_9pc6Qg8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-723462916"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 6:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9141451883877213787</id><published>2012-05-04T13:24:10.159-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T13:24:10.159-06:00</updated><title type='text'>@ PJL,&#xa;&#xa;you make the mistake of thinking that had ...</title><content type='html'>@ PJL,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;you make the mistake of thinking that had you just filed in time you would have gotten justice.  don&amp;#39;t be so naive.  what you would have gotten was a run around and another statement telling you that &amp;quot;had you just done X&amp;quot;....&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it&amp;#39;s just a carrot to give you a false hope that we still have a judicial system.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rick</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/9141451883877213787'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/9141451883877213787'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336159450159#c9141451883877213787' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-873894258"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 1:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2056574407465499590</id><published>2012-05-04T10:26:16.188-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T10:26:16.188-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Our only problem is that We the Sheeple lack the m...</title><content type='html'>Our only problem is that We the Sheeple lack the military-grade weaponry that these state-sanctioned murderers possess.  Until the day that we can rectify that situation and even up the odds, resistance is problematic at best.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/2056574407465499590'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/2056574407465499590'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336148776188#c2056574407465499590' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 10:26 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5098244273271484585</id><published>2012-05-04T06:54:54.321-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T06:54:54.321-06:00</updated><title type='text'>But beware folks. If you think your civil rights h...</title><content type='html'>But beware folks. If you think your civil rights have been violated by police, prosecutor, or a judge, &lt;b&gt;see a lawyer right away&lt;/b&gt;. There is a statute of limitations on when you can file a suit against any of these people (or the governments they represent), if you can file a suit at all.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I had cops take a computer from my home with a bogus search warrant. We went to the judge the next day and told him the computer held privileged attorney-client documents (namely my entire trial strategy). The judge ordered that the state police not give any of those documents to the prosecutor. Just before they started investigating the computer several months later the lab talked to the prosecutor who gave them the search strings to find those documents. They found them, turned them over to the local cops and the prosecutor who had them in their possession for months before we knew about it. We complained to the judge and he ordered everything sealed. The damage was already done though. 18 months later I went to trial - with the same prosecutor! The state never tried to &amp;quot;fashion&amp;quot; a remedy to fix the fact that he had inside knowledge about my defense strategy. I was convicted on 1 of 9 counts and spent years in jail awaiting my appeal - which I eventually won. The CT Supreme Court lambasted the cops and the prosecutor for their behavior. But the bottom line (so far) is that I can&amp;#39;t sue because I didn&amp;#39;t file suit within 2 years of finding out that the prosecutor had the stuff. Doesn&amp;#39;t matter that I didn&amp;#39;t get a ruling on that until 5 years later - I had to file and then hope it would work out. Some of my story is &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.rush-to-juidgement.com&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Don&amp;#39;t wait. Find a good civil rights attorney and get things going.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/5098244273271484585'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/5098244273271484585'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336136094321#c5098244273271484585' title=''/><author><name>PJL</name><uri>http://www.rush-to-judgement.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1736745393"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 6:54 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1962114973837639406</id><published>2012-05-04T06:48:10.278-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-04T06:48:10.278-06:00</updated><title type='text'>good job, Will. Thanks!</title><content type='html'>good job, Will. Thanks!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/1962114973837639406'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/1962114973837639406'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336135690278#c1962114973837639406' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1794207346"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 4, 2012 at 6:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4144579168270980264</id><published>2012-05-03T21:38:18.693-06:00</published><updated>2012-05-03T21:38:18.693-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If cops... excuse me, Reavers, were worth the time...</title><content type='html'>If cops... excuse me, &lt;a href=&quot;http://blog.kentforliberty.com/2012/01/reavers-everywhere.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Reavers&lt;/a&gt;, were worth the time I would HATE them.  But I have no energy to waste hating them or any other disgusting disease or parasite.  I have a life to live.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/4144579168270980264'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2686712940822717482/comments/default/4144579168270980264'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html?showComment=1336102698693#c4144579168270980264' title=''/><author><name>Kent McManigal</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05005964583189815410</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-XDS5j4fY-sM/Tt5wgUmUlxI/AAAAAAAAAUI/ZgGJCCjqSPg/s220/Me%2B11-23-2011a.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/05/everyday-evil-of-americas-torture-state.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2686712940822717482' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2686712940822717482' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1703325864"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 3, 2012 at 9:38 PM"/></entry></feed>